1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4 exf4? { Grabs the pawn, but after 4.e5 the knight is attacked and must go all the way back to g8. } 4. e5 { Attacks the knight on f6. } 4... Ng8 { The only safe square. White leads in development and has a space advantage for the pawn. } 5. Nf3 d6 *
